      en: ["The peak reaches a maximum elevation of 2,282 meters above sea level.", "Pico Pijol National Park was officially established on August 5, 1987.", "The protected area covers approximately 122 square kilometers of land.", "The mountain is part of the Sierra de Sulaco range in northern Honduras.", "Its cloud forest habitat is a sanctuary for the resplendent quetzal.", "The mountain acts as a vital water source for the surrounding Yoro region."],
